1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,645
Every lead you miss is a
customer who went somewhere else.

2
00:00:03,645 --> 00:00:06,573
Here's how Kyntlo makes sure
you never miss one again.

3
00:00:07,424 --> 00:00:10,633
Kyntlo puts every
conversation in one inbox.

4
00:00:10,633 --> 00:00:16,104
Texts, emails, WhatsApp, Facebook,
Instagram, website chat and phone calls,

5
00:00:16,104 --> 00:00:17,052
side by side.

6
00:00:17,903 --> 00:00:19,734
Each customer has one thread.

7
00:00:19,734 --> 00:00:24,973
Liam messaged on Facebook, then phoned,
then got a text, and it's all in one place.

8
00:00:25,823 --> 00:00:29,394
Assign conversations, so
everyone knows who's replying.

9
00:00:29,394 --> 00:00:34,393
