bookings sit right alongside the chat.

10
00:00:35,261 --> 00:00:36,194
Now, the big one.

11
00:00:36,194 --> 00:00:39,817
When you can't pick up, plenty of
callers won't leave a voicemail.

12
00:00:39,817 --> 00:00:42,672
They'll simply ring the
next business on their list.

13
00:00:43,528 --> 00:00:45,540
Missed-call text-back fixes that.

14
00:00:45,540 --> 00:00:49,990
Seconds after a missed call, Kyntlo
sends a friendly text, automatically,

15
00:00:49,990 --> 00:00:51,576
from your business number.

16
00:00:52,426 --> 00:00:56,931
The caller replies, and now you have
a conversation instead of a lost lead.

17
00:00:56,931 --> 00:00:59,093
Answer in seconds, and book them in.

18
00:01:01,627 --> 00:01:05,660
The full inbox, with texts and
WhatsApp, comes with Growth and Pro.

19
